<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ product.title }}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    {{ 'swiper-bundle.min.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0807/0086/6801/files/spage-YH105489-18-HR_2.css?v=1792463914">

    {% comment %} 落地页内容 {% endcomment %}
    <div
      id="root"
      data-page-id="18"
      style="
        --wrapper-mw:1432px;
        --primary-color:#1BBA85;
        --secondary-color: #F5FFF7;
        --third-color: #BA1C1C;
        --btn-color:#fff;
        --btn-bg-color:#1BBA85;
      "
    >

      {% comment %} 公告栏 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="announcement-bar-w">
        Vremenski ograničen program potpore za rehabilitaciju: <strong>Uštedite do <span class="js-bind-discount-percent">60%</span> danas · 30 dana probnog razdoblja bez rizika</strong>
      </div>

      {% comment %} 头部 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sph" id="sp-shopping-header" data-sp-header aria-label="Page header">
        {%- liquid
          assign sph_logo = logo | default: '' | strip
          if sph_logo == blank and settings.logo != blank
            assign sph_logo = settings.logo | image_url: width: 600
          endif
          if sph_logo == blank
            assign sph_logo = 'https://zapieers.com/cdn/shop/files/zapieers.png?v=1775205855&width=240'
          endif
        -%}
        <div class="sph__bar">
          <div class="sph__inner ">
            <div class="sph__left">
              <a
                class="sph__logo sph__scroll"
                href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
                aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
              >
                <img
                  src="{{ sph_logo }}"
                  alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
                  width="178"
                  height="48"
                  loading="eager"
                  decoding="async"
                >
              </a>
              
            </div>

            <div class="sph__right">
              <nav class="sph__nav" aria-label="Section navigation">
                <a class="sph__nav-link sph__scroll" href="#size" data-sph-target="size">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/size.png?v=1777014292"
                    alt=""
                    width="18"
                    height="18"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                  <span>Tablica veličina</span>
                </a>
               
                <a class="sph__nav-link sph__scroll" href="#reviews" data-sph-target="reviews">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/comment.png?v=1777014292"
                    alt=""
                    width="18"
                    height="18"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                  <span>Recenzije</span>
                </a>
               
                <a class="sph__nav-link sph__scroll" href="#faq" data-sph-target="faq">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/faq.png?v=1777014292"
                    alt=""
                    width="18"
                    height="18"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                  <span>Česta pitanja</span>
                </a>
              </nav>

              <button class="sph__cart js-cart" type="button" aria-label="Open shopping cart">
                <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/cart2.png?v=1790577401" alt="">
                <span class="text" style="color: currentColor;">Košarica</span>
                <span class="sph__cart-count js-cardNum{% if cart.item_count < 1 %} sp-gray{% endif %}">
                  {{- cart.item_count -}}
                </span>
              </button>

              <a class="sph__cta sph__scroll" href="#shopping" data-sph-target="shopping">
                <span>Kupite sada</span>
              </a>

              <button
                type="button"
                class="sph__menu-toggle js-header-menu-btn"
                aria-label="Open navigation menu"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="sph-drawer"
              >
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sph__drawer-backdrop js-header-menu-btn" data-header-menu aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <aside class="sph__drawer" id="sph-drawer" data-header-menu aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sph__drawer-head">
            <strong>Izbornik</strong>
            <button type="button" class="sph__drawer-close js-header-menu-btn" aria-label="Close navigation menu">
              ×
            </button>
          </div>
          <nav class="sph__drawer-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
            <a class="sph__drawer-link sph__scroll js-header-menu-btn" href="#size" data-sph-target="size">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/size.png?v=1777014292"
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <span>Tablica veličina</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sph__drawer-link sph__scroll js-header-menu-btn" href="#reviews" data-sph-target="reviews">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/comment.png?v=1777014292"
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <span>Recenzije</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sph__drawer-link sph__scroll js-header-menu-btn" href="#faq" data-sph-target="faq">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/faq.png?v=1777014292"
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <span>Česta pitanja</span>
            </a>
            <button class="sph__drawer-link js-cart js-header-menu-btn" type="button">
              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/add-cart.png?v=1788945807" alt="">
              <span
                >Košarica (<span class="js-cardNum">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>)</span
              >
            </button>
          </nav>
        </aside>
      </section>

      {% comment %} 产品功介绍和服务 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sp-product-intro" id="product-intro">
        <div class="sp-product-intro__inner">
          <div class="sp-product-intro__main">
              <div class="sp-product-intro__rating stext20 reveal-on-scroll">
                <img
                  class="sp-product-intro__trustpilot"
                  src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/df7602c7facea48f153b8c79c2f851aa.svg?v=1791443228"
                  alt="Trustpilot"
                  width="88"
                  height="22"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                >
                <span>4.7 / 5</span>
              </div>

              <h2 class="sp-product-intro__title stitle2 reveal-on-scroll">Napokon! Pravo olakšanje neuropatske boli u stopalima*</h2>
              <div class="sp-product-intro__media reveal-on-scroll" data-sp-intro-video>
                <video
                  class="sp-product-intro__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  preload="none"
                  poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/1_2x_e1ddcb96-fe38-47b6-b160-32abe31b7625.webp?v=1790156158"
                  width="720"
                  height="720"
                  data-sp-intro-player
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/3db4d63a91634c32b4c56ed960a109e0.webm" type="video/mp4">
                </video>
              </div>
            <div class="sp-product-intro__copy reveal-on-scroll">
              <p class="sp-product-intro__desc stext2">
                <strong>Naša ugrađena „trostruka terapija”</strong> pomaže ublažiti bol u stopalima, utrnulost, oticanje i umor — bez
                skupih zahvata ili oslanjanja na lijekove protiv bolova. Jednostavno ih obujte i dopustite da ciljana potpora svodu stopala,
                stabilizacija pete i amortizacija koja ublažava udarce svakom koraku pruže umirujuću udobnost.
              </p>

              <ul class="sp-product-intro__features">
                <li class="sp-product-intro__feature">
                  <span class="sp-product-intro__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <p class="stext2">
                    <strong>Potpora svodu stopala</strong>
                    ispravlja položaj stopala, pomaže u liječenju plantarnog fascitisa i potiče cirkulaciju.*
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class="sp-product-intro__feature">
                  <span class="sp-product-intro__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <p class="stext2">
                    <strong>Prostrani prednji dio</strong>
                    pomaže kod čukljeva i vraća prste u prirodan položaj.*
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class="sp-product-intro__feature">
                  <span class="sp-product-intro__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <p class="stext2">
                    <strong>Amortizacija pete</strong>
                    ublažava bol u peti te sprječava padove i ozljede.*
                  </p>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <a class="common-button sp-product-intro__cta" href="#shopping">
                OSTVARITE&nbsp;<span class="js-bind-discount-percent" style="color: #fff;">60%</span>&nbsp;POPUSTA SAMO DANAS!
                <img class="btn-arrow" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/right.png?v=1790561295" alt="right">
              </a>

              <div class="sp-product-intro__stock stext2">
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0990/0215/5371/files/icons8-_-96.apng?v=1783565616"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    alt=""
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                </span>
                <span>Šaljemo sutra</span>
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Zalihe</span>
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-bar" aria-hidden="true">
                 <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="80.59375" height="13.85546875" viewBox="0 0 80.59375 13.85546875" fill="none"><rect  x="0.5" y="0.5" width="79.59375" height="12.85546875" rx="6.427734375"    fill="#E3E3E3" ></rect><path   fill="url(#linear_border_61_49_0)"  d="M6.92774 -2.98023e-07L73.666 -2.98023e-07C77.4921 -2.98023e-07 80.5938 3.10165 80.5938 6.92774C80.5938 10.7538 77.4921 13.8555 73.666 13.8555L6.92774 13.8555C3.10165 13.8555 -5.96046e-08 10.7538 -5.96046e-08 6.92774Q-5.96046e-08 5.51862 0.544621 4.231Q1.0705 2.98767 2.02909 2.02909Q2.98767 1.0705 4.23099 0.544621Q5.51862 -2.38419e-07 6.92774 -2.98023e-07ZM6.92774 1Q5.72141 1 4.62055 1.46563Q3.55686 1.91553 2.73619 2.73619Q1.91553 3.55686 1.46563 4.62055Q1 5.72141 1 6.92774C1 10.2015 3.65394 12.8555 6.92774 12.8555L73.666 12.8555C76.9398 12.8555 79.5938 10.2015 79.5938 6.92774C79.5938 3.65394 76.9398 1 73.666 1L6.92774 1Z"></path><g mask="url(#mask-61_49)"><rect x="0.5" y="0.5" width="13.806640625" height="17.58984375"   fill="#FF0000" ></rect></g><defs><linearGradient id="linear_border_61_49_0" x1="0.5" y1="6.927734375" x2="80.09375" y2="6.927734375" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FF0000"  /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF2424"  /></linearGradient><mask id="mask-61_49" style="mask-type:alpha" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><rect  x="0.5" y="0.5" width="79.59375" height="12.85546875" rx="6.427734375"    fill="#E3E3E3" ></rect><path   fill="url(#linear_border_61_49_0)"  d="M6.92774 -2.98023e-07L73.666 -2.98023e-07C77.4921 -2.98023e-07 80.5938 3.10165 80.5938 6.92774C80.5938 10.7538 77.4921 13.8555 73.666 13.8555L6.92774 13.8555C3.10165 13.8555 -5.96046e-08 10.7538 -5.96046e-08 6.92774Q-5.96046e-08 5.51862 0.544621 4.231Q1.0705 2.98767 2.02909 2.02909Q2.98767 1.0705 4.23099 0.544621Q5.51862 -2.38419e-07 6.92774 -2.98023e-07ZM6.92774 1Q5.72141 1 4.62055 1.46563Q3.55686 1.91553 2.73619 2.73619Q1.91553 3.55686 1.46563 4.62055Q1 5.72141 1 6.92774C1 10.2015 3.65394 12.8555 6.92774 12.8555L73.666 12.8555C76.9398 12.8555 79.5938 10.2015 79.5938 6.92774C79.5938 3.65394 76.9398 1 73.666 1L6.92774 1Z"></path></mask></defs></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-low">NISKE</span>
              </div>

              <p class="sp-product-intro__secure stext2">
                <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
                Zajamčeno sigurno &amp; zaštićeno plaćanje | SSL zaštita
                <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sp-product-intro__services ">
            <article class="sp-product-intro__service reveal-on-scroll">
              <img
                class="sp-product-intro__service-icon"
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/30day-18.png?v=1791529439"
                alt=""
                width="92"
                height="92"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <div class="sp-product-intro__service-body">
                <h3 class="sp-product-intro__service-title stexts2">30 dana jamstva povrata novca</h3>
                <p class="sp-product-intro__service-text stext2">
                  Ako niste zadovoljni, vraćamo vam puni iznos u roku od 30 dana
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="sp-product-intro__service reveal-on-scroll">
              <img
                class="sp-product-intro__service-icon"
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/shopping.png?v=1790155525"
                alt=""
                width="92"
                height="92"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <div class="sp-product-intro__service-body">
                <h3 class="sp-product-intro__service-title stexts2">Dostava s praćenjem diljem svijeta</h3>
                <p class="sp-product-intro__service-text stext2">
                  Svaka narudžba ima praćenje uživo i osiguranje paketa.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="sp-product-intro__service reveal-on-scroll">
              <img
                class="sp-product-intro__service-icon"
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/good17.png?v=1790155524"
                alt=""
                width="92"
                height="92"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <div class="sp-product-intro__service-body">
                <h3 class="sp-product-intro__service-title stexts2">Potvrđeno od stvarnih korisnika</h3>
                <p class="sp-product-intro__service-text stext2">
                  Razvijeno i testirano na temelju stvarnih povratnih informacija
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      {% comment %} 视频列表介绍 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sp-video-list" id="video-list">
        <div class="sp-video-list__inner">
          <h2 class="sp-video-list__title stitle2 reveal-on-scroll">Jedan par za sve — evo kako:</h2>

          <div class="sp-video-list__grid">
            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster=""
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/89deb24008d3490a8d185bc1f15fc7aa.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Potiču cirkulaciju krvi
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Ergonomska potpora svodu stopala nježno podupire tabane i potiče zdraviju i učinkovitiju cirkulaciju
                  krvi.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster=""
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/d22784a7c9a84d03957632ba8fc61f5c.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Pomažu ublažiti bol
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Prostrani prednji dio smanjuje pritisak na živce te pomaže ublažiti bol i utrnulost uzrokovane neuropatijom stopala.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster=""
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/8e173d0994c844c5af4e7c2dc7cfa5f8.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Pomažu smanjiti oticanje
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Tehnologija amortizacije pete pomaže smanjiti oticanje stopala i podupire oporavak oštećenih živaca.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster=""
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/ae8c464c85774cc695783726e5af927e.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1BBA85"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Jednostavne za svakodnevno nošenje
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Bez lijekova i bez napora — jednostavno ih nosite tijekom svakodnevnog hodanja kako biste ublažili simptome neuropatije.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      {% comment %} 左视频右文案 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sp-video-right-text" id="hidden-cause">
